rows[200011]={title={{17,317446254},"순찰자의 경로"},description={"Being a Ranger is more than just picking up a bow, or fighting from the cover of the trees, $n.  Being a Ranger, at its core, means that you have a profound connection to the wilds. You are its protector.  I sent my falcon, Felo, to scout the surrounding areas, but he has not returned.   Please, find him and direct him to return back to me.","'이'라는 순찰자 단지 활을 들고, 나무의 덮개에서 싸우고 있는 것 이상의 것입니다. $n-  ⁇ 이 순찰자내가 내 말록을 보내서 주변 지역을 탐험했으나 돌아가지 않았어."},objectives={{47,404972093},"클라리시의 발크를 주변에서 찾아봐"}}
